# Binary artifacts: never convert their line endings, never diff them as text.
#
# The workflow guide PDF is pure ASCII (reportlab writes ASCII85 streams), so
# git's heuristic took it for text and core.autocrlf rewrote it on a Windows
# checkout: measured on 2026-09-10, a pull inserted 3589 CR bytes and its
# startxref pointed into the middle of a stream instead of at the xref table.
# tools/doc_sync_audit.py checks both that this line is here and that the
# PDF's startxref still points at its xref table (CLAUDE.md, A29).
#
# Text files are deliberately NOT normalized here: that would rewrite every
# file's line endings in one commit, for no defect.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.gz  binary
*.mat binary
*.nc  binary
